# MAHA POSHAN REGISTER — COMPREHENSIVE SYSTEM AUDIT REPORT
**Document File:** `audit.readme`  
**Generated Date:** September 2026  
**Application Target:** Primary & Upper-Primary Schools across Maharashtra, India  
**Program:** Pradhan Mantri Poshan Shakti Nirman (PM POSHAN / शालेय पोषण आहार)  
**Version:** 1.0.0 (Production Candidate)  
**Repository Architecture:** Local-First Single Page Application (SPA) with Cloud Sync & Micro-Services

---

## 1. Executive Summary

**MahaPoshan Register (महापोषण रजिस्टर)** is a mission-critical, enterprise-grade software application engineered specifically for primary and upper-primary school teachers and headmasters across Maharashtra. It digitalizes, automates, and eliminates manual paperwork for the National Mid-Day Meal Scheme (PM POSHAN).

The application solves key administrative bottlenecks:
1. **Arithmetic Burden Elimination:** Eliminates manual daily gram-to-kilogram conversions for rice, pulses, oil, and condiments.
2. **Official Maharashtra Government Compliance:** Outputs pixel-perfect, audit-ready **Part-2 Official Register Booklets (शाळा स्तरवार दैनिक खर्च नोंदवही)** compliant with Maharashtra Government Resolutions (GR) and Schedule-II standards.
3. **Local-First & Offline Resilience:** Schools in remote rural talukas with zero or unstable internet connectivity can record daily meals without interruption; data automatically syncs to the cloud once connectivity resumes.
4. **Subscription & Access Control:** Provides a multi-tenant administration ecosystem where access requests are routed to Super Admins (`umardesh@gmail.com`) for review, verification, and duration-based activation.
5. **Word-of-Mouth Teacher Referral Engine:** Built-in gamified referral reward program for community school onboarding with automated payout tracking.

---

## 2. Technology Stack & Architectural Matrix

| Layer | Technologies / Libraries | Architectural Role & Implementation Details |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Core Framework** | React 19.0.1, TypeScript 5.8.2 | Component-driven UI, strictly typed interfaces (`types.ts`), React 19 concurrent features. |
| **Build Engine** | Vite 6.2.3, ESBuild | Ultra-fast HMR, production chunk splitting, custom middleware plugins for API mocking and email handling. |
| **Styling & Design System** | Tailwind CSS v4.1.14, Vanilla CSS | Utility-first responsive styling, Government-standard print styling (`@media print`), accessible micro-interactions. |
| **Typography** | Inter, Yantramanav (Devanagari/Marathi), JetBrains Mono | Curated fonts for English, Marathi numerals, and financial audit figures. |
| **State & Storage** | LocalStorage API, In-Memory Caches, Custom Event Busses | Local-First single source of truth (`storage.ts`), optimistic UI updates, TTL-based caching. |
| **Cloud Vault & Database**| Supabase PostgreSQL, Supabase JS v2.116.0 | Multi-tenant relational schema, Row Level Security (RLS), real-time cloud data sync (`cloud-sync.ts`). |
| **Identity & Authentication**| Clerk React SDK v6.16.1 | Secure OAuth, email OTP, session lifecycle, multi-factor support, JWT claims. |
| **Transactional Email** | Resend API SDK v6.28.1 | Edge/Serverless transactional email dispatch for admin notifications and school approvals. |
| **Document Exporting** | SheetJS (XLSX), jsPDF, html2canvas | A4 landscape register rendering, Excel workbook generation with embedded formulas and styling. |
| **Motion & Visuals** | GSAP 3.15, ScrollTrigger, Lucide Icons | Smooth scroll reveals on landing page, micro-interactions, rich SVG icon library. |
| **Hosting & Edge Handlers** | Netlify, Vercel, Node/Express | Static frontend hosting with Edge serverless functions (`/api/send-email`). |

