## 3. Comprehensive Module-by-Module Audit

### 3.1. Public SaaS Landing Page (`src/components/landing/`)
The landing portal is designed to onboard Maharashtra teachers with a modern, trust-building visual aesthetic:
* **Components:** 
  * `LandingNavbar.tsx`: Fixed blur navbar, navigation anchors, quick Teacher Login via Clerk modal, and direct **Admin Login** button.
  * `HeroSection.tsx`: Value proposition in Marathi & English, live interactive meal calculator with student count limited to 3 digits (1–999).
  * `ProblemSolutionSection.tsx`: Contrast between manual physical register errors and automated digital tracking.
  * `FeatureShowcaseSection.tsx`: Highlight of Part-2 booklet, stock ledger, and offline capability.
  * `WorkflowSection.tsx`: Step-by-step 3-stage visual pipeline (Select Dish &rarr; Enter Students &rarr; Instant Report).
  * `ProductPreviewSection.tsx`: High-resolution mockup of the teacher register dashboard.
  * `TimeSavingSection.tsx`: Calculation showing savings of ~15 hours per month per school.
  * `ReportGenerationSection.tsx`: Preview of PDF and Excel generation.
  * `PricingSection.tsx`: Transparent pricing tiers (Term-wise / Annual subscription).
  * `FaqSection.tsx`: 8 detailed FAQs addressing common Maharashtra teacher queries in Marathi.
  * `LandingFooter.tsx`: 4 mandatory legal document links, support contact (`poshanregister@gmail.com`), and Super Admin gateway link.
* **Animations:** GSAP ScrollTrigger timeline animations with `prefers-reduced-motion` accessibility checks.

### 3.2. Authentication & Access Gatekeeper (`src/components/AccessPendingView.tsx`, `src/lib/subscription-store.ts`)
Controls user access before granting entry into the register dashboard:
* **Access Request Submission:** Teacher enters official School Name, 11-digit UDISE number, Kendra/Cluster, District, Mobile Number, and optional Referral Code.
* **Mandatory Legal Check:** Teacher must accept Terms & Conditions and Privacy Policy with version-stamped audit records (`CURRENT_TERMS_VERSION`, `CURRENT_PRIVACY_VERSION`).
* **Lifecycle States:**
  1. `pending`: Access requested, awaiting Super Admin review. Screen displays live status polling every 10 seconds.
  2. `active`: Approved by admin with defined expiration timestamp. Teacher has unlimited access.
  3. `expired`: Subscription duration ended. Prompts teacher to request renewal.
  4. `pending_deletion`: Soft-deleted account with 28-day recovery grace period before cloud purging.
  5. `rejected`: Displays rejection reason and option to correct details.
* **Testing Bypass Emails:** Instant perpetual access for pre-approved test accounts:
  `poshanregister@gmail.com`, `mahaposhan@gmail.com`, `umardesh@gmail.com`, `umardesh11@gmail.com`, `abuzar212ai@gmail.com`.

### 3.3. Super Admin Command Center (`src/components/SuperAdminPanel.tsx`)
A dedicated administrative console accessible via `#super-admin`:
* **Authentication Gate:**
  * Auto-logs in if signed in via Clerk with an authorized admin email (`mahaposhan@gmail.com`, `umardesh@gmail.com`).
  * Alternatively accepts Admin Passcode (`Admin@1234`).
* **Core Capabilities:**
  * **School Verification & Approval:** Review school submissions with UDISE, district, and teacher phone. 1-click modal to set validity (1, 3, 6, 12 months or custom date). Automatically fires confirmation email to teacher upon approval.
  * **Subscription Management:** Extend active accounts, revoke access, or schedule 28-day soft deletion.
  * **Bulk Operations:** Multi-select schools to approve or extend in batch.
  * **Referral Payout Center:** Review referral rewards (₹100/school), copy teacher UPI ID, and record banking UTR reference numbers.
  * **System Broadcast Console:** Configure live system-wide notices displayed across all teacher dashboards.
  * **Diagnostics & Tests:** Real-time Supabase connection health check and Resend email delivery test.

### 3.4. Daily Entry & Consumption Engine (`src/components/DailyEntryView.tsx`, `src/lib/mdm-calculator.ts`)
The daily operational core used by teachers every afternoon:
* **Student Input Boundary:** Restricted to **3 digits (maximum 999)** via `max="999"`, `maxLength={3}`, input slicing, and calculator clamping.
* **Preset Stepper Buttons:** Quick thumb-friendly mobile adjustment buttons (`-10`, `-1`, `+1`, `+5`, `+10`).
* **Predefined Menu Catalog:** Official Maharashtra dishes (उदा. तांदूळ उसळ / पुलाव, खिचडी, चवळी उसळ, मटकी उसळ, वटाणा उसळ, मुग उसळ, सोयाबीन पुलाव).
* **Automated Norm Calculation:**
  * Cooking cost fixed at **₹2.36** per primary student.
  * Rice norm: 100g/student (Primary) or custom recipe norm.
  * Pulses norm: 20g/student.
  * Oil, condiments, vegetables calculated automatically in kilograms to 3 decimal places (`0.000 kg`).
* **Holiday & Sunday Support:** One-click toggles for School Holidays, Sundays, and Mid-Term Vacations (zero consumption, attendance = 0).
* **Recent Entries History:** Quick cards showing the last 5 days with 1-click edit and delete actions.

### 3.5. Monthly Register & Stock Ledger (`src/components/MonthlyRegisterView.tsx`)
Consolidates daily transactions into the official monthly booklet view:
* **Calendar Grid & Daily Roster:** Shows all 31 days with dish served, student count, rice consumed, and cooking cost spent.
* **Dual-Ration Stock Ledger:**
  * Tracks Rice (तांदूळ) and Pulses (डाळी/कडधान्ये) in kilograms.
  * **Columns:** Opening Balance (आरंभीची शिल्लक) + Inward Received (चालू महिन्यात प्राप्त) - Total Consumed (एकूण वापर) = Closing Balance (अखेरची शिल्लक).
* **Discrepancy Detection:** Alerts teachers in real-time if consumption exceeds available stock (negative stock warning).
* **Multi-Month Selector:** Easy navigation across financial year months (June to April).

### 3.6. Official Government Print & Export Subsystem (`src/components/OfficialPrintView.tsx`, `src/lib/excel-export.ts`)
Produces official audit-ready documentation:
* **Government Part-2 Booklet Layout:** Formatted to standard Maharashtra PM POSHAN Schedule-II specs.
* **Print Optimization:** Print-specific CSS (`@media print`) configuring A4 landscape orientation, high-contrast borders, headers, and signature blocks for मुख्याध्यापक (Headmaster), वर्गशिक्षक (Class Teacher), and स्वयंपाकी (Cook).
* **SheetJS Excel Export:** Generates formatted `.xlsx` files with clean columns, auto-width adjustments, and summary totals ready for submission to Kendra Pramukh / Block Education Officer (BEO).

### 3.7. Settings & Ingredient Management (`src/components/AdminSettingsView.tsx`)
Customization suite for individual school requirements:
* **School Profile Configuration:** UDISE, Taluka, District, Center/Kendra, Headmaster Name, Cook Name, Primary vs Upper-Primary categories.
* **Ingredient Rates & Norms:** Ability to adjust market prices for condiments, oil, and vegetables.
* **Recipe Builder:** Create custom dishes with specific gram-per-student allocations.
* **Live Cost Simulator:** Interactive rate calculator for testing meal costs with 1–999 students.

### 3.8. Referral Rewards System (`src/components/ReferralCard.tsx`, `src/lib/referral-store.ts`)
Organic growth engine:
* Generates unique, memorable referral codes for each registered school (e.g. `MP-PUNE42`).
* When a newly referred school registers, the referral record is logged.
* Upon subscription approval, the referrer qualifies for a ₹100 incentive.
* Referrers input their UPI ID (GPay / PhonePe / Paytm) for automated payout processing by Super Admin.

### 3.9. Local-First Cloud Sync Engine (`src/lib/cloud-sync.ts`)
Ensures data safety and offline capability:
* **Local Storage First:** All reads and writes happen instantaneously in the browser's `localStorage` (`pm_poshan_data_v1`).
* **Cloud Sync Pipeline:** Background worker pushes mutations to Supabase PostgreSQL (`daily_entries`, `stock_transactions`, `schools`, `school_profiles`).
* **Concurrency & Deduplication:** In-flight request deduplication map and 15-second caching prevent redundant network calls.
* **Offline Resiliency:** Queues operations when offline and syncs upon reconnection with online/offline browser event listeners.

### 3.10. Transactional Email Alerts (`src/lib/email-service.ts`, `api/send-email.ts`)
Serverless communication powered by Resend:
* **Admin Alert on School Registration:** When a school submits an access request, a high-priority alert email is delivered to **`umardesh@gmail.com`** containing:
  * School Name & UDISE
  * District & Kendra
  * Contact Person & Phone
  * Direct action button linking straight to `/#super-admin`
* **Teacher Approval Confirmation:** Dispatches a celebratory activation email to the teacher with granted duration and expiry dates.
* **Rate Limiting:** In-memory IP rate limiter on serverless functions capping requests at 20 per minute to prevent spam and abuse.

