## 6. Performance & Build Health Analysis

* **Production Bundle Build:** Passed with `0` errors (tested via Vite v6.4.3).
* **Module Transformation:** 1,836 modules transformed cleanly in `~2.2s`.
* **Asset Chunking:**
  * `dist/index.html` — `8.22 kB`
  * `dist/assets/index-*.css` — `99.00 kB`
  * `dist/assets/vendor-core-*.js` — `452.74 kB`
  * `dist/assets/vendor-export-*.js` — `331.81 kB` (contains standalone SheetJS & jsPDF)
  * `dist/assets/vendor-clerk-*.js` — `93.38 kB`
* **Zero Runtime Overhead:** No heavy state management libraries (Redux/MobX) or unnecessary routing frameworks; operations execute in $< 5\text{ms}$.

